  "title": {
   "en": "The Abominable Eye Abomination"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "恐怖 目の怪"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Kyoufu Me no Kai"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Our eyes are important to us. However, we don't usually appreciate their value. Humans only believe what they see with their own eyes. That's because our eyes don't lie. Recently, my eyes have been acting up, so I've been going to the hospital. The doctor in charge is young, handsome, and kind. I was happy that he was going to give me a ride home, but then I saw something I shouldn't have seen... This is a collection of six other gems, including \"The Mysterious Eye,\" which depicts the terrifying experience of a girl with eyes that can see things that other people can't!"
  },
